OL,3,GNEWSAI got my cancer diagnosis after
OL,4,Ahearing radio stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum who was diagnosed with breast
OL,7,Fcancer has said she was inspired to see
OL,8,Fher GP after hearing testimonies of
OL,9,Fsurvivors on the radio.
OL,11,FAdrienn Rozner had felt a lump on her
OL,12,Fleft breast for some time but only had
OL,13,Fit seen by a GP after hearing the
OL,14,Fstories last October during Breast
OL,15,FCancer Awareness month.
OL,17,FShe was referred for a biopsy at the
OL,18,Fhospital and, five weeks later, she was
OL,19,Ftold she had cancer in her left breast.
